(2733480, 378167, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''ve seen very similar shots in this challenge, the fire challenge and the peas challenge. I am guessing it''s the same person entering all three. Why? I don''t know. It barely met the fire challenge (I gave it the benefit of the doubt). It certainly doesn''t fit this or the peas challenge. If you are not the person entering all three there''s a pretty big coincidence going on. It still doesn''t meet this challenge.</td>', 'Ok, I''ve seen very similar shots in this challenge, the fire challenge and the peas challenge. I am guessing it''s the same person entering all three. Why? I don''t know. It barely met the fire challenge (I gave it the benefit of the doubt). It certainly doesn''t fit this or the peas challenge. If you are not the person entering all three there''s a pretty big coincidence going on. It still doesn''t meet this challenge.', '2006-08-16 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
