(2733707, 381182, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is a funny concept.  To improve it in my opinion, I think I would have shot it when the light was not so harsh i.e. early in the morning or after 5:30pm.  I also would have tried to get a shallower depth of field so only the person and the thing he is riding is in focus and the background is out focus.  This can be achieved with a bigger aperture or longer focal length.</td>', 'This is a funny concept.  To improve it in my opinion, I think I would have shot it when the light was not so harsh i.e. early in the morning or after 5:30pm.  I also would have tried to get a shallower depth of field so only the person and the thing he is riding is in focus and the background is out focus.  This can be achieved with a bigger aperture or longer focal length.', '2006-08-16 12:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
