(2735567, 380550, 60614, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I love the green and golds of the grass.  The dark edges seem to distract from the picture.  Unfortunately, I can''t make out what is the stupid situation.  It looks like your subject is doing a cartwheel in the tall grass.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I love the green and golds of the grass.  The dark edges seem to distract from the picture.  Unfortunately, I can''t make out what is the stupid situation.  It looks like your subject is doing a cartwheel in the tall grass.', '2006-08-17 00:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
