(2735590, 379675, 60614, '<td valign="top">Ineresting idea.  This would have been a great stop motion or action shot.  It meets the stupid challenge.  It would be interesting to see what this would look like with a lighter or white background.  Because you seem to loose the lens in the dark background.  Also,  there is some white specks to the left of the lens that is a bit distracting.  I love the movement of the hammer.</td>', 'Ineresting idea.  This would have been a great stop motion or action shot.  It meets the stupid challenge.  It would be interesting to see what this would look like with a lighter or white background.  Because you seem to loose the lens in the dark background.  Also,  there is some white specks to the left of the lens that is a bit distracting.  I love the movement of the hammer.', '2006-08-17 00:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
