(2735816, 379585, 17771, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it really fits the challenge, except for the title. But I do like the shot. The girl is the only sharp part of the photo and the train line draws your eyes straight to her. I can''t look at any part of the photo without naturally looking back to her. Now I understand what it means to lead the viewer through the photo. Thanks.</td>', 'I don''t think it really fits the challenge, except for the title. But I do like the shot. The girl is the only sharp part of the photo and the train line draws your eyes straight to her. I can''t look at any part of the photo without naturally looking back to her. Now I understand what it means to lead the viewer through the photo. Thanks.', '2006-08-17 01:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735827, 377661, 17771, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Would have liked to see a bit sharper.</td>', 'Good concept. Would have liked to see a bit sharper.', '2006-08-17 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
