(2738893, 378723, 3214, '<td valign="top">I like the concept very much.  Don''t know if there was a way to execute it better, though.  But the blur helps enforce how stupid it probably is to go this fast.</td>', 'I like the concept very much.  Don''t know if there was a way to execute it better, though.  But the blur helps enforce how stupid it probably is to go this fast.', '2006-08-18 04:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
