(2743876, 380928, 49672, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny!  I''d like it better in color, without the water(?) stains on the board, but it is still a great idea.</td>', 'Pretty funny!  I''d like it better in color, without the water(?) stains on the board, but it is still a great idea.', '2006-08-20 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
