(2743888, 379675, 49672, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha - that isn''t stupid if it''s for a Canon!!  (Just kidding.)</td>', 'Ha ha ha - that isn''t stupid if it''s for a Canon!!  (Just kidding.)', '2006-08-20 17:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743889, 380948, 61138, '<td valign="top">A fun idea, but the stark overhead lighting and the spotty fork kind of detract from it.<br/> <br/>I like the composition, though.</td>', 'A fun idea, but the stark overhead lighting and the spotty fork kind of detract from it. I like the composition, though.', '2006-08-20 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
