(2744306, 381144, 29556, '<td valign="top">just too dark. Possible to lighten this up a bit? Would make a much better photo I think.</td>', 'just too dark. Possible to lighten this up a bit? Would make a much better photo I think.', '2006-08-20 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
