(2744319, 377661, 29556, '<td valign="top">yikes...hopefully you didnt have to do too many takes.  :) Nice color. How did you get the hand and trap to glow? Interesting.</td>', 'yikes...hopefully you didnt have to do too many takes.  :) Nice color. How did you get the hand and trap to glow? Interesting.', '2006-08-20 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
