(2745400, 380923, 35602, '<td valign="top">Okay, so why did you wreck a camera?  Image is really clear, and your water is very well defined with lots of tonal quality, but why did you wreck the camera?  It hurts to look at this picture.</td>', 'Okay, so why did you wreck a camera?  Image is really clear, and your water is very well defined with lots of tonal quality, but why did you wreck the camera?  It hurts to look at this picture.', '2006-08-21 08:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745401, 381224, 35602, '<td valign="top">Ha ha.  Too bad she wasn''t blonde.  (I will get struck by lightning for that comment.)</td>', 'Ha ha.  Too bad she wasn''t blonde.  (I will get struck by lightning for that comment.)', '2006-08-21 08:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745403, 381233, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Image seemed to have a bit of a hazy cast to it, though.  Also most cameras have a red eye adjustment.  Need to work on clearer detail, contrast, and fixing things such as red eye when taking the image.</td>', 'Very cute.  Image seemed to have a bit of a hazy cast to it, though.  Also most cameras have a red eye adjustment.  Need to work on clearer detail, contrast, and fixing things such as red eye when taking the image.', '2006-08-21 08:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745405, 380003, 35602, '<td valign="top">What an opportunity.  Nice being in the right place at the right time.  Contrast is good, but clarity of image is a bit soft.  Maybe a higher shutter speed.</td>', 'What an opportunity.  Nice being in the right place at the right time.  Contrast is good, but clarity of image is a bit soft.  Maybe a higher shutter speed.', '2006-08-21 08:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745408, 380837, 35602, '<td valign="top">Yep, that is definitely brotherly love.  Great title.  Nice stop motion.  Not sure I see stupid, stupid, but maybe I am just not flexible enough.</td>', 'Yep, that is definitely brotherly love.  Great title.  Nice stop motion.  Not sure I see stupid, stupid, but maybe I am just not flexible enough.', '2006-08-21 08:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745409, 379396, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Nice skin tone on this one.</td>', 'Very creative.  Nice skin tone on this one.', '2006-08-21 08:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745410, 380592, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  Background, though, seems to take away from the detail of the snake.  Need to be sharper on the snake.</td>', 'Love the idea.  Background, though, seems to take away from the detail of the snake.  Need to be sharper on the snake.', '2006-08-21 08:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745412, 377860, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too long of a title.  Also, you knew that the person did not look for pedestrians, but the image does not support that.  Still, talking on a cell phone while driving is pretty stupid, and illegal in my state.</td>', 'Too long of a title.  Also, you knew that the person did not look for pedestrians, but the image does not support that.  Still, talking on a cell phone while driving is pretty stupid, and illegal in my state.', '2006-08-21 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745413, 380836, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very humorous.</td>', 'Very humorous.', '2006-08-21 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745418, 379850, 35602, '<td valign="top">What would have really worked here is having somebody holding a can of gasoline, and pretending to throw it on this huge fire.  Anyway, you did a great job of capturing the fire without blown out highlights.  Nice low light around the fire, with very little discernible noise.</td>', 'What would have really worked here is having somebody holding a can of gasoline, and pretending to throw it on this huge fire.  Anyway, you did a great job of capturing the fire without blown out highlights.  Nice low light around the fire, with very little discernible noise.', '2006-08-21 08:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745490, 378050, 63633, '<td valign="top">The focus is not on the subject</td>', 'The focus is not on the subject', '2006-08-21 09:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745495, 380278, 63633, '<td valign="top">The colours are great.</td>', 'The colours are great.', '2006-08-21 09:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745514, 379467, 63633, '<td valign="top">I _hope_ this was simulated!</td>', 'I _hope_ this was simulated!', '2006-08-21 09:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745524, 381182, 63633, '<td valign="top">funny!</td>', 'funny!', '2006-08-21 09:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745746, 381000, 9821, '<td valign="top">:) taken at the Altamont Fair</td>', ':) taken at the Altamont Fair', '2006-08-21 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745796, 379612, 64035, '<td valign="top">Although the idea is repeated by other people in the challenge, this is by far the best execution of it - I love the way the socket is lit up - very otherworldly.</td>', 'Although the idea is repeated by other people in the challenge, this is by far the best execution of it - I love the way the socket is lit up - very otherworldly.', '2006-08-21 11:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745800, 380916, 64035, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not the most technically interesting or expert, but it made me laugh out loud, and that''s what this challenge should be about. Very "Far Side", and that''s no bad thing at all.</td>', 'Perhaps not the most technically interesting or expert, but it made me laugh out loud, and that''s what this challenge should be about. Very "Far Side", and that''s no bad thing at all.', '2006-08-21 11:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745803, 380673, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, with a good surreal edge and nice sharp focus. The reflection off the water surface is particularly pleasing and looks professional and glossy.</td>', 'Nice shot, with a good surreal edge and nice sharp focus. The reflection off the water surface is particularly pleasing and looks professional and glossy.', '2006-08-21 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745807, 381143, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia colour, and I like the expression of forlorn shock and dismay on the smaller girls face. A rather different take on this challenge, and novel! Well done!</td>', 'Nice sepia colour, and I like the expression of forlorn shock and dismay on the smaller girls face. A rather different take on this challenge, and novel! Well done!', '2006-08-21 11:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745808, 378452, 64035, '<td valign="top">Not the most original of ideas, but high points for the execution - the lighting is absolutely gorgeous. Well done!</td>', 'Not the most original of ideas, but high points for the execution - the lighting is absolutely gorgeous. Well done!', '2006-08-21 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745812, 379889, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nothing special about the photograph from any kind of standpoint, but the subject matter and opportunism involved makes it perfect for the challenge, and it made me smile, which is great.</td>', 'Nothing special about the photograph from any kind of standpoint, but the subject matter and opportunism involved makes it perfect for the challenge, and it made me smile, which is great.', '2006-08-21 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745817, 380107, 64035, '<td valign="top">Your dog matches your tiles. The colour match and the composition elevate this from "amusing dog photo" to "very good amusing dog photo". Well done!</td>', 'Your dog matches your tiles. The colour match and the composition elevate this from "amusing dog photo" to "very good amusing dog photo". Well done!', '2006-08-21 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745819, 380003, 64035, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this was staged or merely opportunistic, either way, it''s brilliant.</td>', 'I don''t know if this was staged or merely opportunistic, either way, it''s brilliant.', '2006-08-21 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2745931, 380985, 27137, '<td valign="top">does not fit the challenge</td>', 'does not fit the challenge', '2006-08-21 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746072, 381120, 54728, '<td valign="top">Though of course, it''s not a great photo, fuzzy and all, I like the general tone and colors.</td>', 'Though of course, it''s not a great photo, fuzzy and all, I like the general tone and colors.', '2006-08-21 13:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746087, 381182, 60281, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept! A tighter crop may have given it more intensity.</td>', 'This is a great concept! A tighter crop may have given it more intensity.', '2006-08-21 13:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746099, 379778, 54728, '<td valign="top">It is stupid, but the picture is not great.  Sharper focus and fixing crooked horizon would have improved it.</td>', 'It is stupid, but the picture is not great.  Sharper focus and fixing crooked horizon would have improved it.', '2006-08-21 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746100, 380928, 60281, '<td valign="top">It seems a little soft to me. A shade more contrast and a touch more sharpening. Im not sure where the sharpness went  is it a focus issue or lost in post-prossesing?</td>', 'It seems a little soft to me. A shade more contrast and a touch more sharpening. Im not sure where the sharpness went  is it a focus issue or lost in post-prossesing?', '2006-08-21 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746101, 380985, 60281, '<td valign="top">Fantastic close-up but it doesnt say stupid to me.</td>', 'Fantastic close-up but it doesnt say stupid to me.', '2006-08-21 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746108, 381223, 60281, '<td valign="top">It seems to have a lot of noise. I dont get the impression it was intentional and so I assume it is the result of a high ISO because the light level was too low. I like the way you have cropped the image.</td>', 'It seems to have a lot of noise. I dont get the impression it was intentional and so I assume it is the result of a high ISO because the light level was too low. I like the way you have cropped the image.', '2006-08-21 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2746115, 378879, 60281, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice composition, well lit and very stupid. It is only spoilt by the slight fuzziness. It looks like the focus is to far back.</td>', 'Great shot, nice composition, well lit and very stupid. It is only spoilt by the slight fuzziness. It looks like the focus is to far back.', '2006-08-21 13:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
