(2751194, 378723, 45549, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments, but I think I need to clarify a few issues:<br/> <br/>1) These are the instruments of a car. I am surprised that so many people thought I was both driving AND taking the shoot. Nope, I was the co-driver.<br/> <br/>2) This shot was NOT made specifically for this challenge. We had to catch  a flight, and we were 300km away from the airport 4 hours before departure, so we drove as fast as we could. Of course we couldn''t drive like this the whole journey (we were at about 100-120km/h most of the time) BUT there was this straight segment of the road, slightly sloped down, about 10 km straight, with NO traffic and very good visibility. So we just wanted to see how fast can this car could go (Ford Focus 1.6).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-23 03:48:52.</i></td>', 'Thank you for your comments, but I think I need to clarify a few issues: 1) These are the instruments of a car. I am surprised that so many people thought I was both driving AND taking the shoot. Nope, I was the co-driver. 2) This shot was NOT made specifically for this challenge. We had to catch  a flight, and we were 300km away from the airport 4 hours before departure, so we drove as fast as we could. Of course we couldn''t drive like this the whole journey (we were at about 100-120km/h most of the time) BUT there was this straight segment of the road, slightly sloped down, about 10 km straight, with NO traffic and very good visibility. So we just wanted to see how fast can this car could go (Ford Focus 1.6).', '2006-08-23 04:00:37.000000', '2006-08-23 04:48:52.000000', 0),
