(2752017, 379419, 49166, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments!!! 1st challenge - 4th place - I''ll take it even though it was a "stupid" challenge....<br/>Passed up the sign on the way to a wedding (hence the dress) - on the way back saw a storm brewing on the horizon, remembered the sign, stopped, and was able to take 3 pictures. Between the traffic and the heat (97F) my wife didnt want to stand on side of the road very long.<br/>To answer some of the comments - Yes the sign is real and I have seen a few of them in the Southeast US. I think they are "stupid" signs so I thought it would fit the challenge very nicely. Thanks Again!</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments!!! 1st challenge - 4th place - I''ll take it even though it was a "stupid" challenge....Passed up the sign on the way to a wedding (hence the dress) - on the way back saw a storm brewing on the horizon, remembered the sign, stopped, and was able to take 3 pictures. Between the traffic and the heat (97F) my wife didnt want to stand on side of the road very long.To answer some of the comments - Yes the sign is real and I have seen a few of them in the Southeast US. I think they are "stupid" signs so I thought it would fit the challenge very nicely. Thanks Again!', '2006-08-23 10:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
