(2790996, 380889, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hiya..<br/>Welcome to DPC.. .<br/>I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently..<br/> <br/>Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)<br/>Cheers<br/>----------------------------------------<br/> <br/>Commical shot.. I love the setup and composition.. work on your lighting. i think it''ll be an impressive photo.</td>', 'Hiya..Welcome to DPC.. .I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently.. Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)Cheers---------------------------------------- Commical shot.. I love the setup and composition.. work on your lighting. i think it''ll be an impressive photo.', '2006-09-03 04:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
