(4491976, 381236, 14986, '<td valign="top">Great first entry!  A lot to take in and some thoughtful details went into the set up.  I might have arranged a few less tools and made them more obvious.  I tend to like a more simple look to a photo and it appears you were right at the edge of trying to do too much with this shot.</td>', 'Great first entry!  A lot to take in and some thoughtful details went into the set up.  I might have arranged a few less tools and made them more obvious.  I tend to like a more simple look to a photo and it appears you were right at the edge of trying to do too much with this shot.', '2008-02-17 04:40:50.000000', NULL, 0),
